    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Two-handed iron-headed maul on a long ash haft. Heavy, slow, and absolutely uninterested in your finesse. The Bulwark's first real weapon — the one you swing when subtlety has already failed.</p><p>Heavy two-handed kinetic. No signature — Surge still does the work; the maul just makes the impact mean it.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Two-handed, heavy. Pairs well with a Bulwark's Surge.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d12 + 3 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(blunt)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Melee (Violence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Reach:</strong> Melee</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T4</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Crowned (+3). Keyed to a true name. It will not be sold.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>+3 to hit and +3 damage</strong> with this weapon (the hit bonus is read from the weapon you swing).</li>\n  <li>Grade raises it to <strong>Tier IV</strong> · soulbound — one bearer, no sale.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->"
    }
  },
